{"suttaId":"tha-ap187","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[7088,7106],"vripara":"24"},"segments":{"tha-ap187:0.3":"Isimuggadāyakattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap187:1.1":"“Udentaṃ sataraṃsiṃva, pītaraṃsiṃva [sitaraṃsiṃva (sī.)] bhāṇumaṃ;","tha-ap187:1.3":"Kakudhaṃ vilasantaṃva, padumuttaranāyakaṃ.","tha-ap187:2.1":"“Isimuggāni pisitvā [isisuggāni piṃsetvā (sī.), isimuggaṃ nimantetvā (syā.)], madhukhudde anīḷake;","tha-ap187:2.3":"Pāsādeva ṭhito santo, adāsiṃ lokabandhuno.","tha-ap187:3.1":"“Aṭṭhasatasahassāni, ahesuṃ buddhasāvakā;","tha-ap187:3.3":"Sabbesaṃ pattapūrentaṃ [pattapūraṃ taṃ (sī.)], tato cāpi bahuttaraṃ.","tha-ap187:4.1":"“Tena cittappasādena, sukkamūlena codito;","tha-ap187:4.3":"Kappānaṃ satasahassaṃ, duggatiṃ nupapajjahaṃ.","tha-ap187:5.1":"“Cattālīsamhi sahasse, kappānaṃ aṭṭhatiṃsa te;","tha-ap187:5.3":"Isimuggasanāmā [mahisamantanāmā (syā.)] te, cakkavattī mahabbalā.","tha-ap187:6.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap187:7.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā isimuggadāyako thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap187:8.1":"Isimuggadāyakattherassāpadānaṃ pañcamaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
